# BMAD + Beads Protocol

## State First
Run `bd prime` at session start. Run `bd ready --json` for work.

## Triage (New Work Only)
If creating new work: read .bmad/methodology/triage.md
L1: Direct fix. L2: Light plan. L3-L4: Pour molecule.

## Methodology On-Demand
Load persona/template files ONLY when your task description references them.
Do NOT load all of .bmad/ into context.
Personas: .bmad/personas/{role}.md
Templates: .bmad/templates/{type}.md

## Execution Rules
- Claim before working: `bd update <id> --status in_progress --claim`
- Discovered new work: `bd create "title" -t task --deps discovered-from:<current>`
- Need decision: `bd create "Decision: X vs Y" -t gate` + include in output
- Done: `bd close <id> --reason "summary"` then `bd sync`
- NEVER leave tasks in_progress when ending session
